close_reason: "Delivered deterministic cache-scoped MCP surfaces, bounded JSON Schema 2020-12 validation, authority-safe resource semantics, shared SDK contracts, current generated artifacts, and exact full-suite proof."
body: "## Surface contract\n\n- tools/list, prompts/list, resources/list, resources/read, and resources/templates/list return ttlMs and public or private cacheScope.\n- Tool ordering is deterministic and stable enough for prompt caches.\n- listChanged and subscriptions/listen invalidation align with TTL hints and never allow stale authorization decisions.\n- inputSchema and outputSchema accept applicable JSON Schema 2020-12 keywords and resolve references under bounded depth, bytes, and composition work.\n- structuredContent accepts any JSON value while tool result envelopes remain predictable.\n- Resource-not-found returns Invalid Params and recovery identifies the missing URI without leaking unrelated resources.\n- Contract generation, SDK types, MCP tool definitions, docs, golden files, and packed artifacts derive from one source."
